	.string "by the way...\p"
	.string "And it's still expanding!\p"
	.string "So far, we have two zones open\n"
	.string "and 4 more on the way!\p"
	.string "Enjoy the SAFARI ZONE! I'll\n"
	.string "call you when the other zones\l"
	.string "are ready!$"

